  json: "{\"Options\":[{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":32}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-184.132446,\"yPos\":343.665863},\"ID\":22,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Dlaczego
    Lady Edith przysz\u0142a w\u0142a\u015Bnie do Pani?\",\"parentUIDs\":[21],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":27}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":440.2662,\"yPos\":334.999481},\"ID\":23,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Czy
    stosuje Pani jakie\u015B sztuczki by wzmocni\u0107 klimat sesji?\",\"parentUIDs\":[21],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":25}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":732.2662,\"yPos\":335.7994},\"ID\":24,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Dzi\u0119kujemy
    za informacje Madame Selmo.\",\"parentUIDs\":[21],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":21}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":252.26712,\"yPos\":1123.79773},\"ID\":28,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Zmie\u0144my
